WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.886
Today's experiment: turn the server rack into 3D.

00:00:04.886 --> 00:00:10.005
It is just inference. Send it to the cloud, it builds it.

00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:13.013
Digital twin, done!

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:16.670
Wait, there is one behind it.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:21.013
Inference filled in what it could not see.

00:00:21.013 --> 00:00:25.023
The racks are infinite? I bill per rack.

00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:27.994
The racks came out of the tablet!

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:33.023
The photo went out, and the racks came back infinite.

00:00:33.023 --> 00:00:37.034
The only finite option is keeping it on-prem.

